 bird ally even  al-mundhir with a party of men who had  joined them  they sent letters to the governor's  telling them to proclaim a general call  to arms to the Muslims to fight off  these unexpected tyrants whose  unprovoked attack on a defenseless  region was without precedent people  gathered from all sides and rallied at  Cordova at their head was the eunuch Abu  Alpha nazia the favorite of the Emir  avid al Rahman who hastened out with a  great multitude and a very great show of  force  meanwhile the Norseman may God curse  them had arrived ship after ship and  occupied the city of Seville  they spent seven days there killing the  men and enslaving the women and children  until the command has arrived and clash  with them again and again causing more  and more casualties until the death toll  began to have an effect on them and it  became clear that they had been defeated  the greatest battle against them took  place on a Wednesday when there were  five nights left of the month of safar  in the year 238 44 in the village of  Tejada  near Seville  [Music]  God destroyed many of them and they died  there and 30 of their ships were burned  and many of their dead were hung from  posts and others from the trunks of the  palm trees of Seville from the day that  they entered Seville and overcame its  inhabitants to the day of their defeat  and the final departure of the survivors  was 40 days God caused their leader to  die and reduced their numbers and news  of their victory was sent to the  provinces not only in al-andalus but  also to the Berber armies of the North  African coast to a flaw in avid  al-wahhab the Lord of tahat and client  of the Umayyads and two others they were  sent the heads of the leader and his two  hundred paladins God calmed the  agitation of al-andalus which had  shuddered at such audacity against its  people and the defiance of its power and  dispelled its fear isa eben ahmed  al-razi remarking on this news said the  fleet of the Norseman may god destroy  them coming from the western sea which  is adjacent to them seized Seville at  the beginning of the year to 3844 the  first point at which they disembarked  was the island of capital some way off  the river a place dedicated to horse  breeding they disembarked on the Sunday  twelve nights after the beginning of  Muharram in the year 238 44 and their  ships were 80 in number on the second  day after their arrival four ships were  sent off to Korea Del Rio which stands  on the banks of the river to the west of  the city inhabited by Yemeni Arabs from  Yasu known as the Bhanumati four miles  from the place where they disembarked at  Cobb hill  they immediately sacked the village and  killed everyone they encountered there  in a great attack the first that they  carried out against the Muslims this  village has continued to be a rebut and  during the reign of the caliph Ovid  al-rahman third a congressional mosque  was built there because formerly it did  not have a place for prayers then on  Wednesday the third day after their  arrival the Norseman may God curse them  left the village of capital and set out  in the direction of the city of Seville  when they reached the Church of the  water  Camas at Alma to fosox from the city and  they were already closed the Muslims of  the city and others who joined them  decided to fight off the infidels they  sallied out against them filled with  great courage and determination but  without discipline they had no  designated leader not even a  standard-bearer because the governor had  deserted and fled to the city of Carmona  leaving them with no support on which  they could rely when the Norseman  approached the town from the river the  weakness of the people and their  diminishing numbers were clear to them  so they set out in their ships after  them shooting flight after flight of  arrows against them so that they  scattered then they disembarked and  fought them on the riverbanks most  vigorously and with re